 the resumption or termination of a suspension do not make a measure one that permits subject to conditions; a measure that suspends approvals, permitting, construction, or interconnection until a specified condition is satisfied qualifies.\\n\\nEnactment occurs when a bill becomes law under the state's constitution and laws, whether by gubernatorial signature, veto override, becoming law without signature, approval at a statewide referendum election, or any other legal mechanism by which statutes can be enacted. For an initiated or referred statute or constitutional amendment, or other voter referendum, the relevant law is considered to have been enacted on the election day on which it was approved, as reflected in the certified results, regardless of when the measure is certified or takes effect. Passage by one or both chambers, or a Governor's announced intent to sign, is not enactment.\\n\\nExecutive orders, agency orders, and other measures which are not statutory or constitutional do not qualify as enactment regardless of legal force. A provision removed by line-item veto is not enacted unless the veto is overridden as to that item. The operative text of the measure at enactment controls; provisions amended out before enactment do not qualify.\\n\\nThe moratorium provision must be mandatory on its face. A statute that merely authorizes a state agency or the Governor to impose a moratorium at their discretion does not qualify. A statute that directs suspension of approvals or interconnection upon a specified condition qualifies only if the condition is objectively determinable and is not deferred to be determined by the implementing agency's findings, certifications, or completion of its own proceedings.\\n\\nThis market resolves based on the date of enactment, not the effective date. Resolution will not be affected by failure to implement a law, judicial invalidation, repeal, or expiry that follows a relevant enactment, or an effective date that comes after the date of enactment.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be official information from the state government of Texas; however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\", \"probs\": {\"150144\": {\"Yes\": 0.0215, \"No\": 0.9785}, \"150145\": {\"Yes\": 0.145, \"No\": 0.855}, \"150146\": {\"Yes\": 0.215, \"No\": 0.785}, \"150147\": {\"Yes\": 0.305, \"No\": 0.695}}}","lang":"en"}]],[["2728279071703314472","broadcasts"],[{"id":"betby_trading","type":"iframe","url":"{\"rules\": \"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Houthi military forces enter any part of Aden, Yemen by the specified date, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\n\\\"Houthi military forces\\\" refers to the military forces of the Houthi movement (Ansar Allah), including any armed force operating under its direction or on its behalf.\\n\\n\\\"Aden\\\" refers to the following districts of Aden Governorate, Yemen: Craiter (Sirah), At Tawahi, Al Mualla, Khur Maksar, Ash Shaikh Outhman, Dar Sad, and Al Mansura. Al Buraiqeh district (Little Aden) is excluded and entry into Al Buraiqeh alone will not qualify.\\n\\n\\\"Enter\\\" means that the Houthi military forces, even temporarily, deliberately operate within any part of Aden, other than as prisoners of war or as emissaries as described below. Bombardment, sabotage, naval presence offshore, or temporary disruption of activity will not qualify on their own. An announcement, threat, or claim of Houthi entry will not qualify without actual entry being established.\\n\\nThe entrance of Houthi emissaries for the purpose of negotiating an agreement or other diplomatic or commercial endeavors will not alone qualify.\\n\\nIn the event of genuine ambiguity, this market may remain open for three days after the specified date. If Houthi entry into Aden is not established by the end of the third calendar day, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of credible reporting.\", \"probs\": {\"150144\": {\"Yes\": 0.009, \"No\": 0.991}, \"150145\": {\"Yes\": 0.165, \"No\": 0.835}, \"150146\": {\"Yes\": 0.07, \"No\": 0.93}}}","lang":"en"}]],[["2729270018633240581","widget"],[{"id":"statscore","type":"scoreboard","event_id":6873802}]],[["2729097425024339971","widget"],[{"id":"statscore","type":"scoreboard","event_id":6540081}]],[["2729239777395220499","widget"],[{"id":"statscore","type":"scoreboard","event_id":6838726}]],[["2729452628776980521","broadcasts"],[{"id":"cns","type":"iframe","url":"https://player.twitch.tv/?channel=eih_pacific_division"}]],[["2729432389620219936","broadcasts"],[{"id":"oddin","type":"iframe","url":"https://host.vpplayer.tech/player/ptkzurmc/vjsnksxg.html","lang":"zh"},{"id":"oddin","type":"iframe","url":"https://player.kick.com/valhalla-cup","lang":"en"},{"id":"oddin","type":"iframe","url":"https://player.twitch.tv/?channel=valhalla_cup","lang":"en"}]],[["2729432389620219936","widget"],[{"id":"oddin","type":"statistics","url":"https://disir.oddin.gg/rush_soccer/match?availableData=stats&availableData=ranking&awayTeamId=dGVhbS9vZDpjb21wZXRpdG9yOjIxNTg4&brandToken=1370b41f-60a4-49f9-a6f5-0d3456b7a781&darkMode=true&homeTeamId=dGVhbS9vZDpjb21wZXRpdG9yOjIxMDA0&id=bWF0Y2gvb2Q6bWF0Y2g6MzM5MTMxMw%3D%3D&lang=en&layout=default&t=110211482&theme=dark&timeframe=TWO_MONTHS&tournamentId=dG91cm5hbWVudC9vZDp0b3VybmFtZW50OjE1NDM4&type=stats"},{"id":"oddin","type":"scoreboard","url":"https://disir.oddin.gg/rush_soccer/scoreboard?brandToken=1370b41f-60a4-49f9-a6f5-0d3456b7a781&darkMode=true&id=bWF0Y2gvb2Q6bWF0Y2g6MzM5MTMxMw%3D%3D&lang=en&layout=&t=3854281673&theme=dark"}]],[["2729441774568361999","broadcasts"],[{"id":"cns","type":"iframe","url":"https://player.twitch.tv/?channel=bg_england"}]],[["2729268743501926436","widget"],[{"id":"statscore","type":"scoreboard","event_id":6552869}]],[["2728837120918704174","widget"],[{"id":"statscore","type":"scoreboard","event_id":6846778}]],[["2716054935241367553","broa